			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401290801,
					"content": "祖莉亞夫人、菲米尼，我們先來畫畫吧？比起王冠，我更想看看繪本的新內容！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290802,
					"content": "其實是在期待派蒙女神的樣子吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290803
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290803,
					"content": "#哎呀！{F#妳}{M#你}知道就好了，不是一定要說出來的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290804,
					"content": "哈哈！好，我知道了，那麼今天的故事應該是這樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亞·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290805,
					"content": "在歷經千難萬險後，王子與他的勇者們終於抵達了水妖王國的入口。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亞·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290806,
					"content": "這時，同伴中的小精靈派蒙，向大家展現了她的真實身分——一位隱藏的女神。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亞·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290807,
					"content": "好耶！女神出場了！女神大大地讚揚了勇者們的誠實，作為獎勵，她灑下好多好多祝福，然後還許願王子一定能夠完成目標！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290808,
					"content": "沐浴在女神的榮耀下，王子與勇者衝入了邪惡的巢穴，驅逐了魔物，拯救了被關押的可愛水妖。王子終於奪回了王國，但王冠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亞·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290809,
					"content": "哎呀，王冠還沒有做好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290810,
					"content": "不…王冠就在那裡，逃跑的魔物將它秘密地帶走了，邪惡仍不死心——但王子很快就會奪回王冠，絢爛的彩虹會重新降臨在王國中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290811,
					"content": "唔…這個解釋…很有身歷其境的感覺！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290812,
					"content": "哇，真好…祖莉亞夫人畫得真好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290813,
					"content": "謝謝，這下繪本的第二頁也完成了，「特爾克西」的歷險離終點越來越近，他會加冕為王…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亞·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290814,
					"content": "而我的孩子，你一定也會在那時振作起來吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亞·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290815,
					"content": "-.-  ..-.   ..-  -...  .---  -.  ..-. -.  -...  -.  -...  ---",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「特爾克西」"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290816,
					"content": "一定會的，祖莉亞夫人！而且說不定今天妳回家後，就能聽見醫生的好消息了呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290817,
					"content": "借您吉言，女神大人。對了，菲米尼先生，關於王冠的製作…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亞·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290818,
					"content": "一天的時間是夠的，請放心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290819,
					"content": "麻煩你了，那麼最後的歷險還是放在兩天後吧！大家依舊在這裡集合，好嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亞·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290820,
					"content": "沒問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290821
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290821,
					"content": "那兩天後見了，可愛的朋友們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亞·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290837,
					"content": "♪♫♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亞·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290822,
					"content": "哎呀！夫人回去了，我們差不多也該回去了，菲米尼還有工作要做吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290823,
					"content": "嗯，我待會要去城裡買一些零件用來製作王冠的底座，我打算做幾個不同的方案，然後選出最適合的那個。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290824,
						401290825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290824,
					"content": "菲米尼很認真。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290826
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290825,
					"content": "菲米尼很努力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290826
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290826,
					"content": "是呀，我以前只知道菲米尼不會輕易接受別人的委託，沒想到一旦接受了委託會這麼用心呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290827,
					"content": "…可能…因為…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290828,
					"content": "什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290829,
					"content": "因為…我希望…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290830
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290830,
					"content": "哎呀，怎麼吞吞吐吐的，那是什麼表情呀？感覺立刻就要臉紅戴上頭盔躲起來了呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290831,
					"content": "啊！我臉紅了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290832,
					"content": "不要為難菲米尼了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290833
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290833,
					"content": "嘿嘿，好啦！菲米尼，那今天就不打擾你的工作了哦，我們兩天後再見吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290834,
					"content": "…謝謝…好…兩天後見…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290835
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290835,
					"content": "兩天後見。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290836
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290836,
					"content": "…我希望所有身處困境的人們，都能看到美好的東西，都能看到奇蹟…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				}
			]
		},
